94 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 77 0 R
/E (This report aims to highlight business performance from three main perspectives: overall sales performance, customer and product behavior, and the impact of the trial campaign on store performance. The business recorded total sales of $1.93 million through approximately 265,000 transactions and 72,000 unique customers, with an average transaction value of $7.30. Overall, the analysis shows a relatively balanced and stable sales pattern, reflecting a solid demand base.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
95 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 77 0 R
/E (In terms of customer behavior analysis, the Mainstream segment accounted for the largest share of sales, with approximately $750,000 in sales, while the Older Singles/Couples life-stage segment recorded the highest sales, with total sales of $402,000.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
96 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 77 0 R
/E <>
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2]
>>
