97 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 77 0 R
/E (From another perspective, the most significant difference was observed in the results of the trial campaign. The comparison with the control stores showed three clearly different outcomes: Store 77 experienced a 72.8% decline in sales, while Store 86 recorded a 4.5% increase in sales, and Store 88 achieved a significant increase of 217.0%. This growth was not limited to sales, but was also accompanied by a 161.32% increase in the number of customers and a 17.90% increase in the average number of transactions per customer.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
98 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 77 0 R
/E (Overall, the results indicate that the effectiveness of the campaign was related to the characteristics of each individual store. Therefore, before expanding the campaign, the characteristics of the stores that achieved strong results should be identified, while the reasons for weak performance in other stores should be investigated before generalizing the strategy.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
