/E (This report aims to focus on understanding what drives revenue and where and how the impact of business initiatives is reflected. To achieve this, transaction data were analyzed, in addition to customer and product characteristics and store characteristics, which facilitates the interpretation of financial results through purchasing behavior and customer base composition.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [0]
>>
