/E (The overall performance of the business shows that it remained relatively stable throughout the analysis period, with 264,836 transactions recorded from 72,637 unique customers and total sales of approximately $1.93 million. The average transaction value was $7.30, while the average quantity was 1.91 units, indicating that the business relies on a high volume of purchases with relatively limited individual quantity and value.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [0]
>>
